.cloudflared/

# Playwright
.playwright*/

# QA screenshots and other transient gate artifacts (local agent evidence; not committed).
# Catches both the dedicated qa-screenshots/ dir AND ad-hoc qa-* files at repo root
# (e.g. qa-phase1-01-checkin-header-desktop.png) that older recipes drop here.
qa-screenshots/
/qa-*

# Claude agent state — runtime only, never tracked at any depth.
# Exception: .claude/agents/ at the repo root holds project-level sub-agent
# instructions (UX contracts, conventions) that ARE intended to ship in the
# repo so every contributor / future clone gets the same agent behavior.
# Subdirectory .claude/ (e.g. backend/.claude/, frontend/.claude/) remain
# fully ignored — we don't want per-area agent drift.
#
# Pattern note: `**/.claude/*` matches contents at any depth WITHOUT excluding
# the parent directory, which is what allows the negation `!.claude/agents/`
# to actually re-include children. The narrower `.claude/*` rule on its own
# left backend/.claude/ + frontend/.claude/ untouched.
**/.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
